'''Maushold''' (Japanese: '''イッカネズミ''' ''Ikkanezumi'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

