==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration features {{form|Maushold|Family of Three}} {{p|Maushold}}, while its illustration rare artwork features both Family of Three and Family of Four Maushold.
*Both of this card's illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Maushold|168}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

